This software builds on third-party open-source packages, each distributed under
its own license, including:

  - LightRAG (lightrag-hku) — hybrid vector + graph retrieval engine
  - FastMCP — MCP server framework
  - aiohttp — async HTTP client
  - NumPy — numerical arrays

Optional, run as external services and not bundled with this software:

  - Ollama — local model serving (embeddings; optional generation)
  - ngrok — HTTPS tunnel for exposing the local MCP server to Claude.ai
